OL,3,GNEWSAWestminster setting NI budget     
OL,4,Awould be massive overreach - O'Neill   
OL,6,FThe government setting Stormont's      
OL,7,Fbudget would be a "massive overreach", 
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister      
OL,9,FMichelle O'Neill has said.             
OL,11,FShe described the prospect as a        
OL,12,F"dangerous precedent" and said the     
OL,13,Fpower-sharing executive would continue 
OL,14,Fpressing Westminster for "fairer       
OL,15,Ffunding".                              
OL,17,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president said she  
OL,18,Fhad asked Deputy First Minister Emma   
OL,19,FLittle-Pengelly to join her in seeking 
OL,20,F"direct engagement" with Prime Minister
OL,21,FAndy Burnham on the budget stalemate.  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
